core/src/test/resources/tfc-sample/ holds unmodified TerraFirmaCraft data files (EUPL-1.2, commit
c3b4d9536b82e5a9746dd793c586720a74108057) used as test fixtures; its SOURCES.txt lists each file's TFC path.
